# Server-only Google Maps key. Never put this in frontend code or NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
# In Google Cloud: enable Places API (New) and Geocoding API only.
# Restrict this key by this server's IP. Set a monthly quota and a billing budget alert.
# GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_KEY=
# Internal usage meter on the SuperAdmin API page (not Google's invoice).
# GOOGLE_MAPS_MONTHLY_QUOTA=10000
# Browser map key belongs in the frontend env only, referrer-restricted to this site.
# Enable Maps JavaScript API on that key. Never copy the server key into it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_BROWSER_KEY=
